<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welcome to Smart Plan Blueprint</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { background-color: #fff; padding: 20px; }
        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
        .credentials { background-color: #e9ecef; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to Smart Plan Blueprint</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear {{ name }},</p>

        <p>Your merchant account for <strong>{{ merchantName }}</strong> has been successfully created.</p>

        <p>You can now access the merchant portal using the following credentials:</p>

        <div class="credentials">
            <p><strong>Login URL:</strong> https://portal.smartplanblueprint.com/login</p>
            <p><strong>Username:</strong> {{ email }}</p>
            <p><strong>Temporary Password:</strong> {{ password }}</p>
        </div>

        <p><strong>Important:</strong> For security reasons, please change your password immediately after your first login.</p>

        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact our support team.</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>The Smart Plan Blueprint Team</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        <p>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Smart Plan Blueprint. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
